 * shorthand property.
 * - sub: Specifies the keywords and functions related to the `font-variant-position` longhand
 * property.
 * - super: Specifies the keywords and functions related to the `font-variant-position` longhand
 * property.
 * - text: Specifies the keywords and functions related to the `font-variant-emoji` longhand
 * property.
 * - titling-caps: Specifies the keywords and functions related to the `font-variant-caps` longhand
